        "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nHomarr: v1.59.2\nUnraid: 7.2.4\n\nAble to see cpu usage and memory, but not disk\n\n<img width=\"584\" height=\"311\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16a10f15-337e-4642-8c2f-d2770c2c2a56\" />\n\nAdded integration and all, viewer permissions.\nThanks in advance!\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nLatest Homarr, try to see disks on unraid using unraid integration\n\n### Impact\n\nPretty much have to leave the dashboard for this crucial data\n\n### Additional information\n\nUp until now I was only 0.15 release, so big change for me, unraid integration, and everything is way polished, well done\n\n### Version\n\n1.59.2\n\n### Installation method\n\nDocker Compose\n\n### Browser\n\nFirefox",
